                {
                  "id": "faq-h",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Common questions.",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "eyebrow": "International 360 FAQ"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "faq-list",
                  "type": "widget",
                  "props": {
                    "widget": "faq",
                    "config": {
                      "items": [
                        {
                          "q": "What is International 360?",
                          "a": "International 360 (I360) is a communication tool designed to accelerate the repair process, streamline communications with our service department, and drive greater uptime. It is an all-new communication and fleet management solution that seeks to maximize business efficiency while minimizing total costs."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "Does I360 work with all makes and models?",
                          "a": "Yes. I360 works with all makes and all models, with no surcharges — no monthly or annual per-VIN surcharges."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "Which telematics and maintenance systems does it work with?",
                          "a": "The I360 system works with over 24 industry-leading telematics providers, and it is compatible with a wide variety of fleet maintenance software providers, so it will not hinder your day-to-day operations."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "What can I see and do in I360?",
                          "a": "You can see up-to-date repair status, VIN-based information, repair order numbers, vehicle health reports, parts availability and estimated time of completion. You can start service requests online, approve estimates, schedule appointments, and find parts within dealership inventory."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "How often is repair order status updated?",
                          "a": "Repair order status is updated every 24 hours."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "Is I360 included with new trucks?",
                          "a": "Carolina International Trucks notes that a five-year subscription to International 360 for your entire all-makes fleet is included with the purchase of any new International LT Series, RH Series, and LoneStar models. Ask your dealership about your specific purchase."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "How do I get started?",
                          "a": "Send a request using the form on this page, or contact the Rechtien International or Carolina International location nearest you. International 360 also has a free mobile app."
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "snapshot": {
                      "items": []
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
